      "writtenOn": "2013-06-23T04:10:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "middleware needs to know the existing content type in order to translate it correctly I think. This code was inspired by render_response()\n\nhttps://github.com/openstack/keystone/blob/master/keystone/common/wsgi.py#L515\n\nI do think you have a good point here. Internally, Keystone is operating on JSON data so in theory content-type should be provided by middleware.\n\nPerhaps we need a file a bug for enhancement?",
